---
title: "obligation_deposit_ctoken (Current Finance - Obligation State)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_no_debt: assert(!debts.contains(CoinType))
    q_check_no_debt --> q_error_borrowed: CoinType already borrowed (cannot deposit borrowed asset)
    q_check_no_debt --> q_check_supported: ctokens.is_supporting_collateral(CoinType)?
    q_check_supported --> q_support: support_collateral_token(CoinType) (first deposit)
    q_check_supported --> q_join: ctokens.join_ctoken(ctoken_balance)
    q_support --> q_join
    q_join --> [*]: return

    note right of q_check_no_debt
        INV-001: A single CoinType cannot be both collateral and debt in same obligation
        INV-002: This invariant must hold even under flash loan reentrancy (per contest spec)
    end note

    note right of q_support
        INV-003: First deposit of a CoinType initializes collateral tracking entry
        INV-004: Subsequent deposits of same CoinType just join the balance
    end note
